{"id":"f95558608cb43df9","group":"88","path":"88/88-cor-halting-ce.md","title":"Halting Set is CE","display":"cor-halting-ce — Halting Set is CE","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-cor-halting-ce","aliases":["88-cor-halting-ce"],"display":"cor-halting-ce — Halting Set is CE","depends_on":["[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-halting-problem]]","[[88-df-sigma1-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-cor-halting-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-cor-halting-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-halting-ce — Halting Set is CE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5ec4a3797008b26\" href=\"?note=c5ec4a3797008b26\" title=\"88-thm-halting-problem\">88-thm-halting-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"353b45b92236cdbb\" href=\"?note=353b45b92236cdbb\" title=\"88-df-halting-problem\">88-df-halting-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd611fa3b2c1a451\" href=\"?note=fd611fa3b2c1a451\" title=\"88-df-sigma1-set\">88-df-sigma1-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (binary halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"353b45b92236cdbb\" href=\"?note=353b45b92236cdbb\" title=\"88-df-halting-problem\">88-df-halting-problem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> (arithmetical-hierarchy class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd611fa3b2c1a451\" href=\"?note=fd611fa3b2c1a451\" title=\"88-df-sigma1-set\">88-df-sigma1-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}halting\\text{-}ce} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(H)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus H)\n\\land H\\in\\Sigma_1^0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}halting\\text{-}ce} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(H)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus H)\n\\land H\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>二元停机集是可计算可枚举且为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span>的</li>\n<li>停机集的补集不是递归可枚举</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-thm-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"c5ec4a3797008b26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sigma1-set","status":"resolved","id":"fd611fa3b2c1a451","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sigma1-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CE}$ (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see [[88-df-ce-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sigma1-set","status":"resolved","id":"fd611fa3b2c1a451","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^0$ (arithmetical-hierarchy class, see [[88-df-sigma1-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}halting\\text{-}ce} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(H)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus H)\n\\land H\\in\\Sigma_1^0","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false}],"bytes":841,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c5ec4a3797008b26","b283fc95a9b1376d","353b45b92236cdbb","fd611fa3b2c1a451"]}